# Jaguar XF X250 four-door saloon, 2008-2015.
#
# The first XF: the Ian Callum saloon with the oval headlamps, the mesh
# grille, the strong shoulder line and the rotary gear selector. The X250
# ran from the 2008 launch to the 2015 X260.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar_XF_(X250)
#
# Dimensions 4.961 x 1.877 x 1.460 m, wheelbase 2.909 m.
#
# Shape reference: NO true level profile exists. Image 1 is a motor-show car
# about 15-20 degrees off the flank; the front and rear three-quarters show
# the lamps and tail. The flank is estimated; the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (a), the 2013 model year Jaguar XF UK Specification and Price
# Guide: Ebony, Polaris White, Lunar Grey and Carnelian Red. Weights 18, 16,
# 14, 12, total 60, provisional.
#
# Speed 250 km/h. Comfort 95/473, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 95. Classes 2,3.
# Dates are road presence: 2008 intro, retires staggered 2029-2032.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/jaguar-xf-x250.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/jaguar-xf-x250.dae. References:
# citycars/references/jaguar-xf-x250/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the oval headlamps are approximated by a rectangular rim,
# the mesh grille is a flat dark panel and the chrome side vent is a small plate.
# The rear window and boot are slightly longer and more upright than the
# photographs, and the wheels are plain discs. At 128 px the low fastback
# roofline, oval lamps and mesh grille read as an X250 XF.


